# Source material, kept on The Key and never shipped.
#
# Squarespace exports come out as full-resolution originals and the
# audio masters are lossless. Both are the things to keep, and both
# are far too large for a repo that Netlify redeploys on every push.
# What ships is the web-sized derivative in assets/, committed.
_source/
